<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1305174455"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1587914632"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="On My Head"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Perlo"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Day by Day"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:38.940"><div begin="00:05.770" end="02:38.940"><p begin="00:05.770" end="00:08.210" itunes:key="L1">I think it's all in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想这一切都只是我的幻想</span></p><p begin="00:08.210" end="00:10.030" itunes:key="L2">But how can I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我又怎能确定</span></p><p begin="00:10.030" end="00:12.420" itunes:key="L3">Said I'll see you again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说我会再见到你</span></p><p begin="00:12.420" end="00:14.430" itunes:key="L4">When I know I won't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管我知道这不可能</span></p><p begin="00:14.430" end="00:16.710" itunes:key="L5">Falling down from the start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从一开始就在坠落</span></p><p begin="00:16.710" end="00:18.840" itunes:key="L6">Now I'm on my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我头朝下</span></p><p begin="00:18.840" end="00:21.380" itunes:key="L7">Looking up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望你所在的地方</span></p><p begin="00:21.380" end="00:26.200" itunes:key="L8">Starting again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重新开始</span></p><p begin="00:26.200" end="00:30.180" itunes:key="L9">Wanted to feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾渴望感受</span></p><p begin="00:30.180" end="00:34.780" itunes:key="L10">Wanted to hold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾渴望拥抱</span></p><p begin="00:34.780" end="00:37.960" itunes:key="L11">I wanted to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾渴望知晓</span></p><p begin="00:37.960" end="00:39.740" itunes:key="L12">Tell me babe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我，宝贝</span></p><p begin="00:39.740" end="00:41.890" itunes:key="L13">Was it all a waste?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切是否只是徒劳</span></p><p begin="00:41.890" end="00:44.640" itunes:key="L14">Do you love me or let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是爱我，还是让我离开</span></p><p begin="00:44.640" end="00:49.310" itunes:key="L15">I'm done looking out for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再为你守候</span></p><p begin="00:49.310" end="00:53.470" itunes:key="L16">It's all I know how to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我唯一知道的方式</span></p><p begin="01:00.290" end="01:02.750" itunes:key="L17">I think it's all in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想这一切都只是我的幻想</span></p><p begin="01:02.750" end="01:04.620" itunes:key="L18">But how can I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我又怎能确定</span></p><p begin="01:04.620" end="01:07.120" itunes:key="L19">Said I'll see you again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说我会再见到你</span></p><p begin="01:07.120" end="01:09.040" itunes:key="L20">When I know I won't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管我知道这不可能</span></p><p begin="01:09.040" end="01:11.390" itunes:key="L21">Falling down from the start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从一开始就在坠落</span></p><p begin="01:11.390" end="01:13.440" itunes:key="L22">Now I'm on my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我头朝下</span></p><p begin="01:13.440" end="01:15.790" itunes:key="L23">Looking up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望你所在的地方</span></p><p begin="01:15.790" end="01:20.740" itunes:key="L24">Starting again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重新开始</span></p><p begin="01:20.740" end="01:24.740" itunes:key="L25">Wanted to feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾渴望感受</span></p><p begin="01:24.740" end="01:29.190" itunes:key="L26">Wanted to hold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾渴望拥抱</span></p><p begin="01:29.190" end="01:32.490" itunes:key="L27">I wanted to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾渴望知晓</span></p><p begin="01:32.490" end="01:34.350" itunes:key="L28">Tell me babe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我，宝贝</span></p><p begin="01:34.350" end="01:36.240" itunes:key="L29">Was it all a waste?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切是否只是徒劳</span></p><p begin="01:36.240" end="01:39.110" itunes:key="L30">Do you love me or let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是爱我，还是让我离开</span></p><p begin="01:39.110" end="01:44.130" itunes:key="L31">I'm done looking out for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再为你守候</span></p><p begin="01:44.130" end="01:48.780" itunes:key="L32">It's all I know how to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我唯一知道的方式</span></p><p begin="01:53.060" end="01:56.450" itunes:key="L33">And I can't make you feel</p><p begin="01:56.450" end="01:58.550" itunes:key="L34">Something that you don't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些你本不存在的情绪</span></p><p begin="01:58.550" end="02:04.400" itunes:key="L35">And I won't wait until<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再等待</span></p><p begin="02:04.400" end="02:07.560" itunes:key="L36">Wait until you change your mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待你改变心意</span></p><p begin="02:07.560" end="02:09.110" itunes:key="L37">Tell me babe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我，宝贝</span></p><p begin="02:09.110" end="02:11.390" itunes:key="L38">Was it all a waste?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切是否只是徒劳</span></p><p begin="02:11.390" end="02:14.060" itunes:key="L39">Do you love me or let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是爱我，还是让我离开</span></p><p begin="02:14.060" end="02:18.880" itunes:key="L40">I'm done looking out for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再为你守候</span></p><p begin="02:18.880" end="02:22.670" itunes:key="L41">It's all I know how to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我唯一知道的方式</span></p><p begin="02:22.670" end="02:26.720" itunes:key="L42">Tell me babe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我吧，宝贝</span></p><p begin="02:26.720" end="02:28.620" itunes:key="L43">Was it all a waste?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切是否只是徒劳</span></p><p begin="02:28.620" end="02:31.670" itunes:key="L44">Do you love me or let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是爱我，还是让我离开</span></p><p begin="02:31.670" end="02:36.370" itunes:key="L45">I'm done looking out for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再为你守候</span></p><p begin="02:36.370" end="02:38.940" itunes:key="L46">It's all I know how to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我唯一知道的方式</span></p></div></body></tt>